{"ticker":{"symbol":"166480.KQ","name":"코아스템켐온","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1390.0,"change_pct":-0.017667844522968212,"market_cap":66852507648.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":1014.0,"week52_high":6100.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":289,"website":"https://www.corestem.com","business_summary":"CORESTEMCHEMON Inc., a bio-pharmaceutical company, engages in the development and production of stem cell therapies for the treatment of incurable diseases in South Korea. It offers NEURONATA-R inj, an autologous bone marrow mesenchymal stem cell therapy for the treatment of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS). The company also engages in the development of various therapy products for the treatment of systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE), multiple system atrophy (MSA), and cerebellar ataxia (CA) diseases. The company has a strategic partnership with ATG Lifetech to deliver precision-driven non-clinical solutions to pharmaceutical companies and biotech ventures. The company was formerly known as Corestem, Inc. CORESTEMCHEMON Inc. was founded in 2003 and is based in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"코어스템케몬(주)는 국내 난치병 치료용 줄기세포치료제 개발 및 생산을 담당하는 바이오제약회사입니다. 근위축성측삭경화증(ALS) 치료를 위한 자가골수 중간엽줄기세포치료제 뉴로나타알주를 선보이고 있다. 이 회사는 또한 전신홍반루푸스(SLE), 다계통위축증(MSA), 소뇌실조증(CA) 질환 치료를 위한 다양한 치료제 개발에도 참여하고 있습니다. 회사는 ATG Lifetech과 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 제약회사와 생명공학 벤처기업에 정밀한 비임상 솔루션을 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사의 이전 이름은 Corestem, Inc.입니다. CORESTEMCHEMON Inc.는 2003년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":45877628490.0,"operating_income":-6352419340.0,"net_income":-2257210800.0,"eps":-435.511897},{"period":"2023","revenue":33657156170.0,"operating_income":-